<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan while RSF drones launch from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting reciprocal diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. An RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, and attacks on Orthodox Christians continue in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, with blasts heard in Addis Ababa. Seed insecurity is threatening Tigray farmers and a psychosocial and spiritual care pilot is being tested. Displaced families in Tigray fear renewed war as hopes of returning home fade, and more than 50,000 people have been displaced by deadly border clashes. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOMmFoX1h5TUFBaVFMVnJ4VkpKOTA1Mzc2U3dORFdENEJ0WlIwSzdvNE1uTVNLa2REeDM2U05HZ0RNX0pLWFVJMzNzVEhBU2x1Z292TlRHWHB1SGZIWU90bjJuWG5PQ0F2dy04Qkx5SzQxaTFBbVB1emRXRVZiZEYzY3p0YXJxLXM2ekVoYjVCUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNbnktbnBwZ3VCRGJYel9YOFRTaE9FVk5NUkdENlhIY2NLWjRqa21YVHZRd01BYTRBQWt4Y0xoeDlhVU1nOHRBeXE5SjZPXzFYbVN4ZDhSQjJEem5RbFZGSDZZZEdrRC0wbEg5S3NtX2duSWxsRjdURTN5ZkVjZ3BIVFFzU2FvNi15MWxOZU4xUFE3RkhpMGZSZ3hDeV9qZkdfMmlFTmNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQOEdEeXB1RDlfTW5uZ3hFM2l3TGtBVXduRHl2eWVuU3dIUzEwMlNtR0RpSVNBZUJTU1dwVkY1dF91WThIWGlra19UWHNjTHMxcDlLUWdsZ0xIb0MtdGdpSEg3U0NqTkJ1T2k1UjlPSGxESmp0MDUtUm9sa25xcmVoRDI3SUhNRU5wODk3X3pLb09PZmtVc2ZKWkZUWFRRRzFnME9sbW9nMjZMY21BNWVpOWhCMHlkdXV3Y3RVdUs1SFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre